  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The time for completion of the reaction and concentration of reactant relation is as follows,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>[</mo><mn>87</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>%</mo><mi>completed</mi><mo>]</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mover><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mover><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mover><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>87</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>So</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
